---
// DayPairs — homepage S3 "A day with it". Four cause/effect Pairs: the
// morning brief (READ), an automatic work-log entry (+3 LINES), a decision
// captured in one line (+1 ENTRY), and Sunday's staleness flag + the
// /weekly-review (REPLACED).
//
// Every left-pane line mirrors the shipped playbooks: thinkos-morning.md,
// session-capture.md, thinkos-capture.md (decision mode — verified entry
// format: ## YYYY-MM-DD — <topic> / **Decision** / **Why** / **Context** /
// **Applies to**), thinkos-session-start.sh, weekly-review.md.
import Pair from './Pair.astro';
import TerminalPane from './panes/TerminalPane.astro';
import FilePane from './panes/FilePane.astro';
import DiffPane from './panes/DiffPane.astro';
---
<section class="border-t border-rule">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1200px] px-6 md:px-10 py-20 md:py-28">

    <header class="mb-14 reveal">
      <h2 class="md-heading">A day with it</h2>
      <p class="mt-5 text-[16px] md:text-[18px] leading-relaxed text-muted max-w-[60ch]">
        Four moments. One command in the morning, one line when you decide
        something, and the rest happens on its own.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="space-y-14 md:space-y-20">

      <!-- BEAT 1 — 08:40 · morning brief (READ) -->
      <div class="reveal">
        <Pair tag="08:40 · one command">
          <TerminalPane slot="left" label="claude code" tag="08:40">
<span class="prompt">&gt;</span> <span class="cmd">good morning</span>

This week (top 3):
  1. v2 ingestion pipeline — cut release
  2. Q3 hiring plan, first draft Friday
  3. clear PR queue (T. + R.)

On your plate today:
  · v2 release notes
  · 1:1 with Priya, 2pm

Calendar: 2 meetings, both afternoon.</TerminalPane>
          <FilePane slot="right" path="01 Now / Current Focus.md" tag="read">
<span class="dim">---</span>
<span class="dim">title:</span> Current Focus
<span class="dim">covers_week:</span> 2026-W24
<span class="dim">---</span>

<span class="read-row"><span class="text-accent">## This week</span></span>

1. Ship v2 ingestion pipeline — cut
   the release this week.
2. Q3 hiring plan, first draft to
   Priya by Friday.
3. Clear two stuck PR reviews (T. and
   R.) — blocked on my sign-off.</FilePane>
        </Pair>
        <p class="mt-4 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted max-w-[58ch]">
          The brief: focus, plate, who you're waiting on — under 250 words.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- BEAT 2 — 14:00 · automatic capture (+3 LINES) -->
      <div class="reveal">
        <Pair tag="14:00 · you typed nothing">
          <TerminalPane slot="left" label="claude code" tag="14:00">
<span class="dim">— no session open —</span></TerminalPane>
          <DiffPane slot="right" path="01 Now / Work Log.md" tag="+3 lines">
<span class="dim"># appended by session capture</span>

<span class="diff-add" style="--d:0ms">+ ### 14:00 — acme-redesign</span>
<span class="diff-add" style="--d:80ms">+ - Edited 12 files in ~/code/acme-redesign</span>
<span class="diff-add" style="--d:160ms">+ - HEAD: a1b2c3d</span>

<span class="dim"># listed in the ledger; removable</span>
<span class="dim"># with /thinkos-undo-capture</span></DiffPane>
        </Pair>
        <p class="mt-4 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted max-w-[58ch]">
          The background job noted where the morning went — folders, file
          counts, a commit hash. Never content.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- BEAT 3 — 16:30 · a decision (+1 ENTRY) -->
      <div class="reveal">
        <Pair tag="16:30 · a call worth keeping">
          <TerminalPane slot="left" label="claude code" tag="16:30">
<span class="prompt">&gt;</span> <span class="cmd">/thinkos-decide</span> we version the API
<span class="prompt">&gt;</span> from day one

Logged to 04 Knowledge/Decisions.md —
date, reasoning, and what it applies to.

/thinkos-decisions will surface it the
next time the question comes up.</TerminalPane>
          <DiffPane slot="right" path="04 Knowledge / Decisions.md" tag="+1 entry">
<span class="diff-add" style="--d:0ms">+ ## 2026-06-11 — API versioning</span>
<span class="diff-add" style="--d:70ms">+ **Decision**: Version the API from day one.</span>
<span class="diff-add" style="--d:140ms">+ **Why**: Breaking changes after launch are</span>
<span class="diff-add" style="--d:140ms">+ costlier than a /v1 prefix up front.</span>
<span class="diff-add" style="--d:210ms">+ **Context**: design review, ingestion v2.</span>
<span class="diff-add" style="--d:280ms">+ **Applies to**: all public endpoints.</span></DiffPane>
        </Pair>
        <p class="mt-4 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted max-w-[58ch]">
          Automatic capture records <em>that</em> you worked. Conclusions need a
          sentence from you — logged with the date, reasoning, and what it
          applies to.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- BEAT 4 — Sunday 20:00 · weekly-review (REPLACED) -->
      <div class="reveal">
        <Pair tag="Sunday · 20:00">
          <TerminalPane slot="left" label="claude code" tag="20:00">
<span class="dim">CURRENT FOCUS STALE: covers_week ended</span>
<span class="dim">2026-06-07 — run /weekly-review</span>

<span class="prompt">&gt;</span> <span class="cmd">/weekly-review</span>

Read 7 days of Work Log. Last week's
focus archived. Proposed for next week:
  1. ship ingestion v2.1
  2. onboarding doc for the new hire
  3. close the Q3 hiring loop

Replace Current Focus with this? (y / n)</TerminalPane>
          <DiffPane slot="right" path="01 Now / Current Focus.md" tag="replaced">
<span class="dim">## This week</span>

<span class="diff-del">- ship v2 ingestion pipeline</span>
<span class="diff-del">- Q3 hiring plan, first draft</span>
<span class="diff-del">- clear PR queue (T. + R.)</span>
<span class="diff-add" style="--d:0ms">+ ship ingestion v2.1</span>
<span class="diff-add" style="--d:90ms">+ onboarding doc for the new hire</span>
<span class="diff-add" style="--d:180ms">+ close the Q3 hiring loop</span></DiffPane>
        </Pair>
        <p class="mt-4 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted max-w-[58ch]">
          When Current Focus expires, every session opens with a one-line
          warning until you run the review.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-baseline md:justify-between gap-4">
      <p class="font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-muted">
        Sample vault content — your real vault has your real notes.
      </p>
      <p class="font-mono text-[12px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase">
        <a href="/guide" class="link-anim text-muted">The full rhythm, dos and don'ts included →</a>
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
